  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>A</mi></math> is event that <math><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></math> drawn ball is red.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>R</mi></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>G</mi></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>49</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
